      description: >-\n          Anything a reader needs about the assessor itself rather than about\n          the object — why a version string looks the way it does, which of\n          several configurations ran.\n\n  ExtraFinding:\n    description: A finding outside the pinned checklist.\n    attributes:\n      key:\n        description: Short stable slug for the finding, e.g. `license-declared`.\n        required: true\n      status:\n        range: ResponseStatus\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/docs/stamped/upstream/stamped-checklist-response-schema.yaml:203:      dependencies:\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/docs/stamped/upstream/checklist-response-pr.md:61:(skill, version, harness, model, date, dependencies), `scope`, and\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/docs/stamped/upstream/paper-schema-drift-issue.md:64:> Is there a process for updating environment specifications when dependencies\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/docs/stamped/divergence.md:141:found the one disagreement that a single shared file prevents: `dependencies`\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
