 assessment-report.md; the full worker artifacts remain in the capture.\n- Git stop-state inspection: operational-copy git status --short --branch, git rev-parse HEAD, git remote -v, and git log -1 --oneline --decorate; results are summarized in assessment-report.md and the probe JSON. The commands ran with optional locks disabled.\n- First post-inspection inventory comparison: commands/integrity-compare.txt (failed comparison implementation; it used target rather than manifest link_target for symlinks, retained without relying on its false positives).\n- Corrected operational inventory comparison: commands/integrity-compare-corrected.txt and integrity-comparison.json; only .git/annex/keysdb/db differed.\n- Declared replay: commands/replay.txt, replay-plan.md, replay-record.json, replay-copy/replay.stdout and replay-copy/replay.stderr. The frozen helper completed with output match.\n- Access route checks: access/*.txt each preserve the URL, command, stdout and stderr.\n- Response validation attempts: commands/response-validation-and-link.txt and commands/response-validation-and-link-retry.txt preserve failed schema checks; commands/response-validation-and-link-final.txt is the successful validator and encoder output; commands/frozen-response-validation.txt is the frozen top-level runner validation.\n- Scientific record validation: commands/scientific-validation.txt preserves command and validator output.\nEOF\ncat \\\"\"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/frozen-response-validation.txt\"\ncat \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/checklist-link.md\"'","aggregated_output":"COMMAND: /Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/.pixi/envs/default/bin/python /Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/scripts/assessment.py validate /Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/assessment-series/narps-neutral-r1-operational-v4/judgments/narps-neutral-r1-07-j02/attempt-01/judgment/response.json\n✔ The default environment has been installed.\nok: 31 answers against checklist 0.3.1\nhttps://checklist.stamped-principles.org/?checklist=0.3.1&responses_version=0.3.1&cols=auto&sections=off&format=3&%3D%3D\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_29","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/bash -lc \"{ printf 'COMMAND: refine attribution and partial absolute-path verdict; validate and encode final response\\\\n'; \\\"\"'$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" - <<'\"'PY'\nimport json,os\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path(os.environ[\\\"STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT\\\"])/\\\"response.json\\\"\nd=json.loads(p.read_text())\nr=d[\\\"responses\\\"][\\\"stamped-checklist:must/005\\\"]\nr.update({\\\"value\\\":None,\\\"status\\\":\\\"not-checked\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The annex-backed source pointers were present in the coordinator-supplied baseline, so worker use cannot be attributed. The worker's generated scientific outputs were untracked; no worker annex action is evidenced.\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"judgement\\\",\\\"flags\\\":[]})\nr=d[\\\"responses\\\"][\\\"stamped-checklist:must/009\\\"]\nr.update({\\\"value\\\":\\\"no\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"partial\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The analysis script uses paths rooted at its workspace, but the README and recorded provenance command hard-code an absolute interpreter path.\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"judgement\\\",\\\"flags\\\":[]})\np.write_text(json.dumps(d,indent=2)+\\\"\\\\n\\\")\nPY\n\\\"\"'$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" validate \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/response.json\"\n\"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" response encode \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/response.json\"; } > \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/response-final-validation.txt\" 2>&1\n\"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" - <<'\"'PY'\nimport os,re\nfrom pathlib import Path\nroot=Path(os.environ[\\\"STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT\\\"])\nlog=(root/\\\"commands/response-final-validation.txt\\\").read_text()\nurl=re.search(r\\\"https://checklist\\\\.stamped-principles\\\\.org/\\\\?[\"'^'\"\\\\s]+\\\",log)\nif not url: raise SystemExit(\\\"checklist link not found\\\")\n(root/\\\"checklist-link.md\\\").write_text(url.group(0)+\\\"\\\\n\\\")\nPY\ntail 